---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About">
    <section class="about page-section">
        <div class="about-intro">
            <img src="/images/about.jpeg" alt="Your Full Name" />

            <div>
                <h3>Current position</h3>

                <p>
                    I am currently a doctoral student at Instituto Nacional de Matemática Pura e Aplicada (<a href="https://www.impa.br" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">IMPA</a>) at Rio de Janeiro.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-text">
                <h3>About me</h3>
            <p>
                I was born in Mexico City and lived in a small city called Pachuca, in 2018 I moved back to the capital where to study both my undergraduate and masters degrees at Escuela Superior de Física y Matemáticas 
                (<a href="https://www.esfm.ipn.mx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ESFM</a>), 
                Instituto Politécnico Nacional (IPN) graduating in 2023 and 2025, respectively. There I worked in complex and quaternionic analysis under the  
                supervision of <a href="https://www.researchgate.net/profile/J-Gonzalez-Cervantes" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Dr. Jose Oscar Gonzalez Cervantes</a>, my thesis for both degrees are available in <a href="/publications/">this site</a>. 

            </p>

            <p>
                In January 2026 I moved to Brazil to try authentic churrasco and, while I was at it, to pursue my doctoral studies. Here I will be working
                 in fluid dynamics under the 
                 supervision of <a href="https://alexei.impa.br" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Dr. Alexei Mailybaev</a>.
            </p>

            <p>
                Outside of my current area of study I enjoy any conversation about holomorphic dynamics, differential geometry and around niche applications of mathematics. 
                More personal information about me might be found <a class="elsewhere-link" href="/elsewhere/"><em>elsewhere</em></a>.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>